Still useless, but with at least a good specialty application. Not worth
keeping in _a_ game, but worth keeping in _the_ game for that reason.

> > Dragonbane: grants reflection when wielded.
> 
> Good.

But it's still only a broadsword against other monsters, which is not as
good as a longsword against the more dangerous ones, and not nearly as
good as a proper artifact. IOW, it's still a _poor_ non-longsword
artifact.

> > Sting: Warning versus all monsters. 
